{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f863934f3598371570bd80ee68078a33ad723c07cb953dd82a1401d088d18946", "ja": "（亜利沙が地方のイベントに出演する事になった。\n初めての場所だから、早めに着くようにしたけど……）", "zh": "（亜利沙要去参加地方活动了。\n因为是第一次去的地方，所以我特意提前到了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c0739deef80820474d6ed39d24e0f6b0d015e19cae09bd43c27f1ba1afdbbb08", "ja": "亜利沙、ちょっと待ってくれ。今場所を確認するから。\nえーっと、確か会場は、駅の東側の……。", "zh": "亚利沙，等一下。我确认一下现在的位置。\n呃……我记得会场是在车站东侧的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c1f6253b655350bfa73b95f245509fb7c0e077f24cb80afbd386ce99cb89aaff", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　道案内なら、\nありさにおまかせください！　こっちですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！要问路的话，就交给亚利沙吧！这边请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "33e6af140fee6368eef24c7a0a47ccb71f3e69592d159c0cfce6f2d153e0a6fe", "ja": "えっ？　あ、ありがとう……亜利沙、詳しいんだな。\nもしかして、住んでいた事があるのか？", "zh": "咦？啊，谢谢……亚利沙，你还真熟悉啊。\n难道你以前住在这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "ec9c013024ee6c1a9d01c6b0d524cd255cda7dd46e1c9a148eecdb5d12bf6305", "ja": "いいえ！　アイドルちゃんのおっかけをしていた時、\nパパと一緒に来たコトがあるんです♪", "zh": "不是！以前追偶像的时候，我和爸爸一起来过这里♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "df505f4881e99ad40cb5a41fbcbfe3e2988c03eb8f4aebcf08372e609880e4cc", "ja": "ありさの大好きなアイドルちゃんが、地方のイベントも\n積極的に出演してたので。遠征には慣れてますよ！", "zh": "因为有些最喜欢的偶像会积极参加地方活动。千里迢迢去追活动这种事，我已经习惯了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b15686fbcb8bf6ebfb5f2523bc0c268efba4119b6d7bbc55424746f1135eac97", "ja": "そうか……本当に熱心なファンだったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……原来你真的是个非常热心的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d57943a94d2e24d325d02c27e2ba46341daa71beec3c1e9df46fa0912bed9c3", "ja": "はいっ！　あ、でも今は、そんなに……\nたまに……月に1、2回しか、行ってませんケド！", "zh": "是的！啊，不过现在，已经没那么热心了……偶尔……一个月也就去1、2次而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "8822b038e0abb5d36900825f6b1b8c8f97257c956db4534b7e0528432ea9b3df", "ja": "今日のイベントも、ありさ大注目の新人アイドルちゃん\nグループが参加してるんですよね……ムフフ♪", "zh": "今天的活动也有那个阿莉莎特别关注的新人偶像女孩组合参加呢……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4047652510e6bebf4295a9dc0ee7b2ec90c793aec1fa81eb8d6d083f5ce9d237", "ja": "まあ好きなものだし、たまにはな……\nとはいえ今日は仕事だから、羽目は外さないように！", "zh": "嘛，毕竟是我喜欢的东西，偶尔放纵一下也无妨……\n不过今天是工作，可别玩得太过火了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "1dcb881fa59141e4a90cad96094615b3bf78ef2fe9b8be25207829d286eac2c3", "ja": "はいっ！　憧れのアイドルちゃんたちとのお仕事……\nありさ、がんばりますよぉ～！！！", "zh": "好！和憧憬已久的偶像们一起工作……有香会加油的哦～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5ed0c8ec1fa8c68fef2f0f0790a03f2eb16e7047d2e0cc42b204f57df37007d8", "ja": "（イベントステージは、何事もなく無事終了した。\n次は、物販を兼ねた握手会だ）", "zh": "（活动舞台顺利结束了。接下来是兼售卖周边的握手会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "71a9eab600b4e6968821ee2ca282b07abb72e99e26b3cdffb54134903cc090d5", "ja": "{$P$}さぁん！　ありさのとこ、\nひとりも来てくれなかったらどうしましょう～！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！要是一个人都不来亚利沙这边，该怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "060d65aed40e0782ac8f5dc580f356a6bdd6c9823fa85bb64e289c67284a0272", "ja": "そんな事はないと思うけど……ほら。\nあっちにもう列ができてるじゃないか。", "zh": "我觉得不会发生那种事……你看。  \n那边不是已经排起队来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "5bbed6ea969b504bc557d290561839d83c414dbe2d2ba21ea5b01cd8307a9acf", "ja": "えっ！？　……ヒェッ！？\nほ、本当に？　ありさにですか……？", "zh": "咦！？……呜哇！？  \n真、真的？是说有利纱吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "97913ae8290b08c0498a6cfa22935c1d1bb183b0fdc37b5a5577f580073da60f", "ja": "あ、もう始まる時間だな。\nよし亜利沙、行ってこい！", "zh": "啊，已经到开始时间了。\n好，亜利沙，上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "7912557deee66a7dc4f66b554c1ef1f503e6343923643cfe4136f77a73880537", "ja": "は、はい～！！", "zh": "好、好的～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1017_staff", "source_sha256": "35e5c85de3a4d4f111ba780f615275b8488c1841a864a4f41b615f450f01ee64", "ja": "前の方に続いて、順番にお願いしまーす！\n……はい、次の方どうぞ！", "zh": "请接着前面的人，按顺序来——！\n……好的，下一位请进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1018_fannootokonoko", "source_sha256": "935c9aee7cf1b4ceb714018cc2ca875095b835a1c42f6581cebfa3f0a84a117a", "ja": "あのっ……僕、ありさちゃんに会いたくて来ましたっ！\n劇場は、遠くてあんまり通えないんですけど……。", "zh": "那个……我是想见亚利沙才来的！\n虽然剧场离得很远，没法经常来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1019_fannootokonoko", "source_sha256": "f82b6ed7893d49326584c309dc5c7d5c115adb4e7fb2178eb0f937b712170d67", "ja": "高校生になったら、バイトしていっぱい通います！\nが、がんばってくださいっ！", "zh": "等我上高中后，就去打工，然后经常来这里！\n请、请加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "0c6812d95816bf3bacc137133cade36e3f0a11ad14d0a44b749c4bc2c83ca500", "ja": "は、はいっ！　がんばりますぅ！\n……あの、来てくれてありがとうございます！", "zh": "好、好的！我会加油的！\n……那个，谢谢你愿意过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "1ad120c8b7c4244b57a3a90cb7ecaefdb7b2ddf8dae118def345ec1af11ff984", "ja": "ありさ、劇場で待ってますから！\nぜったいぜったい、来てくださいね～！！", "zh": "亚利沙会在剧场等您的！\n一定要来，一定要来哦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d8ebb787b130d8ade6039a0aa14ffc8bfc112d8912751a02d1e012ad3d39ba46", "ja": "お疲れさま、亜利沙。はい、冷たいタオル。\n握手の後だから、手を冷やしておくといいぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，亚利沙。来，冰毛巾。\n刚握完手，先把手冷敷一下比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "78f9ac09f141c6b352959f543044df4d20e58422853ec527d7519632f9eb3e39", "ja": "あっ、はいっ！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，好的！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "e86fac82b8713cb902de7829da386b65adb6fbe31ae10ab98212eb2f97dd4063", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nありさ、ファンの人達と握手しちゃいました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n亚利沙和粉丝们握手了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "398ad64afdfc489ff5a08f50d7c02e3083a5b76046a5a92bf7ff16a497070897", "ja": "あ、もちろん、そんな大勢じゃありませんケド！\nありさに、会いに来てくれる人がいるんだなって！", "zh": "啊，当然，没有那么多人啦！\n不过，原来真的有人会特地来见有纱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "bd6843809931e588035e49dba1a96a147ca052644c8af9a058deeb1fcd4dc5e7", "ja": "そうだな。……それで、どうだった？\nファンの人達と、直に接してみて。", "zh": "是啊。……那么，感觉怎么样？\n试着和粉丝们直接接触之后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "897cb00a023b6d591119f43ccf89b92f89253abdf4be5c870d1941885f6097d9", "ja": "えっと……今まではアイドルちゃんと握手をして、\nありさが元気をもらっていたんですケド……。", "zh": "那个……以前都是和偶像们握手，让有栖得到力量，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "608a554e1c526f17913b8307e4472ae10a7328f60d4e56edb9aa2c2a204c85ab", "ja": "不思議です。ありさ、アイドルちゃんになったのに……\nやっぱり、ありさが元気をもらった気がします。", "zh": "真奇怪。明明亚利沙已经成为偶像了……但总觉得，还是亚利沙获得了力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "e9d4508aea0f55e34e13e66728c8c43a0b2ff1fe0fbf2dc1b07ed6a9b8275180", "ja": "あの子が高校生になった時、劇場に観に来て\nもらえるように……ありさ、がんばらなくちゃですね！", "zh": "为了让那个孩子上高中时能来剧场看演出……\n亚利沙也必须要加油才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3d72690051e3a194445d692b613b24e2a2d9925527239abcbaf012d6830581f9", "ja": "うん、そうだな。たくさん観に来てもらえるように、\nこれからも頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，说得对。为了能让更多人来看，\n今后也要加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "619ee7f9b9b41834e76f10b597cd1773c86e7f3957897780169e83fde9f44e0d", "ja": "（この前、亜利沙に「どんなアイドルになりたいか」\nと聞いた時、亜利沙はすぐには答えられなかった）", "zh": "（前些日子问亚利沙想成为什么样的偶像时，她没能马上回答。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_005_1034_p", "source_sha256": "beb6156ae92a39aa1a099264998f605e4284c58bd7780df34a1e49c3a4afa7c8", "ja": "（かつて、自分がアイドルに向けていた憧れが、今は\n亜利沙に向けられ始めた。……頑張ろうな、亜利沙！）", "zh": "（曾经，我对偶像怀有的憧憬，如今开始转向亜利沙了。……加油啊，亜利沙！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
